Malahat Ghoreishi (M.Sc., LUT University, Finland) is a junior researcher in International Business and Entrepreneurship at LUT University School of Business and Management. Her research is in the context of “Industry 4.0 and Circular Economy Ecosystem”. She studies the role of different digital technologies, more specifically artificial intelligence (AI), as an enabler of circular business ecosystems and circular business model innovation, as well as entrepreneurial ecosystems.
